*> Рюкзак 0/1: DP(C + 1) — лучшая ценность при вместимости C; C идёт сверху вниз.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. KNAPSACK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ITEMS VALUE "0101030404050507".
   05 WS-ITEM OCCURS 4 TIMES.
      10 WS-WEIGHT PIC 99.
      10 WS-VALUE  PIC 99.
01 WS-CAPACITY PIC 99 VALUE 7.
01 WS-DP-TABLE.
   05 WS-DP PIC 9(4) OCCURS 8 TIMES VALUE 0.
01 WS-I      PIC 9.
01 WS-C      PIC 99.
01 WS-TAKE   PIC 9(4).
01 WS-OUT    PIC Z(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 4
        PERFORM VARYING WS-C FROM WS-CAPACITY BY -1 UNTIL WS-C < WS-WEIGHT(WS-I)
            COMPUTE WS-TAKE = WS-DP(WS-C - WS-WEIGHT(WS-I) + 1) + WS-VALUE(WS-I)
            IF WS-TAKE > WS-DP(WS-C + 1)
                MOVE WS-TAKE TO WS-DP(WS-C + 1)
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-DP(WS-CAPACITY + 1) TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "Knapsack max value: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
    STOP RUN.
